    "q-45217": {
      "dom_id": "step-q45217",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Express $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[9]{8t}}$ using power notation.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we convert the radical to a fractional exponent:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[9]{8t}}=\\frac{1}{(8t)^{1/9}}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we take the reciprocal and convert the exponent to a negative exponent:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{(8t)^{1/9}}=(8t)^{-1/9}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[9]{8t}}=(8t)^{-1/9}\n$$",
